CATEGORIES:ISEO (iEvents)
DESCRIPTION:iSTUDENTS: The Center for Race\, Immigration\, Citizenship\, a
 nd Equality (RICE) at UC Law San Francisco is conducting a research study 
 on international student experiences in the U.S. If you are on an F\, M\, 
 J visa\, or OPT status\, you’re invited to participate in a short survey
  and a 45-minute interview (in person or via Zoom).\n\nYour voice matters
 —help us understand how immigration status shapes your sense of belongin
 g across race\, language\, culture\, and life goals.\n\n✅ Flexible sched
 uling\n🎁 $20 gift card upon interview completion\n🔒 Confidential and
  IRB-approved\n\nTo participate\, email…\n\nSource: ISEO (iEvents)\n\nht
 tps://calendar.ucsd.edu/event/share-your-story-as-an-international-student
URL:https://calendar.ucsd.edu/event/share-your-story-as-an-international-s
 tudent
END:VEVENT
